<BaseLayout title="About | Yetyellow" description="The background and working principles behind Yetyellow.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Experience in complex delivery. Building depth in applied AI.</h1>
  </section>
  <section class="two-column-copy">
    <aside><p class="section-label">Identity</p><p class="identity-name">Ljupcho<br />Stojcheski</p></aside>
    <div>
      <p class="large-copy">I lead cross-functional engineering work and have spent two decades across software delivery, systems and organisational change. Yetyellow is where that experience meets deliberate hands-on practice in AI, automation and agentic systems.</p>
      <p>The work here is not an attempt to turn every problem into an agent. It is an effort to understand where these systems improve real engineering work, where they introduce risk, and what it takes to make them adoptable.</p>
      <p>Projects, notes and experiments will be added as they become concrete enough to be useful to others.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
